# Repo root is this folder (contains .git); the project sits two levels
# down. Patterns use **/ so they match at any depth -- a pattern with a
# slash but no **/ is anchored HERE and silently misses the project.

# --- environments, caches, editors, tool state ---
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
**/.claude/

# --- archives ---
*.zip
*.7z
*.tar.gz

# --- generated corpus: regenerable from a seed, hundreds of MB ---
**/data/sheets/
**/data/debug/
**/data/labels/
**/data/truth/
**/data/rendered/
**/data/manifest.jsonl
**/data/stage_outputs.json

# --- real planning bundles: architect copyright + applicant personal data ---
**/data/raw/
**/data/derived/
files/

# --- model weights: too large and too churny for git history ---
*.pt
*.pth
*.onnx
*.pkl
**/runs/

# --- models/: exclude CONTENTS, not the directory, so negation works ---
**/models/*
!**/models/*.yaml
!**/models/*.json

# --- committed ---
!**/data/corpus.jsonl